@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Dev only: row counts per table (proves connection string + schema + EF mapping)
GET {{host}}/dev/stats

### Dev only: OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### A1 - existing tee time (200)
GET {{host}}/api/teetimes/1

### A1 - not found (404 ProblemDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/teetimes/999999999

### A1 - not an int (404 from the route constraint)
GET {{host}}/api/teetimes/abc
